<MockSection Path="/menu" Heading="The menu">
    <ChildContent>
        <p>Country cooking from the Swartland's own farms. The kitchen can leave out gluten or dairy on most dishes, if
            you ask when you book.</p>
    </ChildContent>
    <Cards>
        <MockCard Path="/menu/sunday-roast" Title="The Sunday roast" Note="R165" />
        <MockCard Path="/menu/lamb-shank" Title="Lamb shank" Note="R185" />
        <MockCard Path="/menu/chicken-pie" Title="Chicken pie" Note="R125" />
        <MockCard Path="/menu/vegetable-bake" Title="Vegetable bake" Note="R115">Vegetarian.</MockCard>
        <MockCard Path="/menu/malva-pudding" Title="Malva pudding" Note="R65" />
    </Cards>
</MockSection>
<MockSection Path="/children" Heading="For the children">
    <p>A children's menu, each dish R75.</p>
</MockSection>
<MockSection Path="/wine" Heading="Wine">
    <p>Wines from the Swartland and the Riebeek Valley, by the glass or the bottle. Corkage R60.</p>
</MockSection>
<MockSection Path="/find-us" Heading="Find us">
    <p>Open Tuesday to Sunday: lunch 12:00 to 15:00, and dinner 18:00 to 21:30 from Thursday to Saturday. Closed
        Mondays.</p>
    <p>Sixty seats inside and on the stoep, wheelchair access, and parking behind the restaurant. Groups of more than
        twelve, and private functions, by arrangement with the owner.</p>
</MockSection>
